<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85567" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-χρόνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of olden time, ancient,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				125
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of long standing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πολυχρονίων</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χρόνιον</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> Μαρμαριτῶν θρασύτητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					6026
				</span></i>
			 (Cyrenaica, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lasting for long,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νουσήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.23
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				7.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουναρχίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔχειν τὴν ζωήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Long.</u>
					464b25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1299a7
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰώνιος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιότω τέρμα</span>”
				<i>long-protracted,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Lav. Pall.</u>
					128
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιορκίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					38.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.254.14
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.): 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				75b
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -ώτατα τῶν ἀνθρωπίνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.4.16
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>long-lived,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				29b32
			</span></i>, al.: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					87c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				613a25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.18.4
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος, αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					282
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
